{"title":"Berry/40","sourceTitle":"Berry/40/pt-br","html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>Os frutos maduros podem ser colhidos com <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Right mouse button\" src=\"/images/c/c5/RMB.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-file-width=\"15\" data-file-height=\"22\" /></span></span>. Os arbustos selvagens não requerem manutenção e produzirão novos frutos continuamente nas condições corretas de temperatura. Mirtilos e cranberries também são vendidos por <a href=\"/Special:MyLanguage/Trading#Agriculture\" title=\"Special:MyLanguage/Trading\">agricultural trader</a><span style=\"display:none\"><a href=\"/Trading#Agriculture\" title=\"Trading\"> </a></span><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">assets\\survival\\config\\tradelists\\trader-agriculture.json</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261111115807\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.005 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.005 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 35/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 228/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 114/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 155/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.787      1 -total\n 67.10%    0.528      1 Template:Ll\n 29.08%    0.229      1 Template:RMB\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wikinew-vs_:pcache:idhash:183789-0!canonica